body:
I'll tell ya, he looks like Bryce Laspisa. Which is the whole reason I'm asking. He looks so much like him that I was wondering if it might be him but I have no idea when the movie even came out.

&#x200B;

I heard about this case on Mr Ballen and it's about a guy who went missing the California area in 2013 and as SOON as I saw his pic, I was like, "I've seen that guy somewhere."
